WEBVTT

00:12:27.063 --> 00:12:30.888
započinjemo, konačno,
da verujemo u sebe ponovo,

00:12:30.888 --> 00:12:34.729
i da verujemo u svoje mogućnosti

00:12:34.729 --> 00:12:39.122
da stvorimo drugačiju
i prijatniju budućnost,

00:12:39.122 --> 00:12:41.545
i po mom mišljenju,
to je fenomenalno.

00:12:41.545 --> 00:12:45.410
Hvala vam.
(Aplauz)

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:55.902
(Aplauz)

00:12:55.902 --> 00:12:59.724
Hvala vam mnogo.
(Aplauz)